  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Papiii ! Mon Monorpale a pas la forme...\nJ’ai essayé de le soigner, mais ça marche pas...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je pense savoir ce qui ne va pas...\nSa lame a dû s’émousser avec le temps.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah bon ? Et comment je peux l’aider, alors ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006800200062006F006E0020003F00200045007400200063006F006D006D0065006E00740020006A0065002000700065007500780020006C201900610069006400650072002C00200061006C006F007200730020003F00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Selon mon expérience, un bon moyen d’aiguiser\nla lame d’un Pokémon Glaive comme Monorpale...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... c’est Ymphect !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E00200063201900650073007400200059006D0070006800650063007400200021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoi, le Pokémon ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006F0069002C0020006C006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020003F002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le corps d’un Ymphect est incroyablement\nsolide ! Si Monorpale en attaque un avec<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsa lame, celle-ci s’aiguisera naturellement.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vraiment ? Je veux bien essayer, mais où est-ce\nque je vais trouver un Ymphect, moi ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! Hé, toi !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nT’aurais pas un Ymphect, par hasard ? Si oui,\ntu veux bien le laisser affronter mon Monorpale ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On se battra quand t’auras seulement\nun Ymphect dans ton équipe !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E00200073006500200062006100740074007200610020007100750061006E0064002000742019006100750072006100730020007300650075006C0065006D0065006E0074000A0075006E00200059006D00700068006500630074002000640061006E007300200074006F006E002000E9007100750069007000650020002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si Monorpale attaque un Ymphect de sa lame,\ncelle-ci s’aiguisera naturellement !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vois que t’as un Ymphect ! Tu veux bien\nle laisser combattre contre mon Monorpale ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004B002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peut-être plus tard...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500750074002D00EA00740072006500200070006C0075007300200074006100720064002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, OK...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020004F004B002E002E002E00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Super ! Allons-y, alors !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300750070006500720020002100200041006C006C006F006E0073002D0079002C00200061006C006F007200730020002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On a perdu... Mais c’est pas grave.\nTiens, laisse-moi te soigner, Monorpale.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Papapah !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006100700061007000610068002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! Monorpale a l’air d’aller carrément mieux !\nT’as vu, papi ?! C’est génial !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hé hé hé, je te l’avais bien dit !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800E90020006800E90020006800E9002C0020006A00650020007400650020006C2019006100760061006900730020006200690065006E002000640069007400200021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dans ces situations, il n’y a pas mieux\nqu’un Ymphect !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440061006E0073002000630065007300200073006900740075006100740069006F006E0073002C00200069006C0020006E201900790020006100200070006100730020006D0069006500750078000A0071007520190075006E00200059006D0070006800650063007400200021001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "D’ailleurs, Ymphect aussi s’y retrouve dans\ncet échange.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044201900610069006C006C0065007500720073002C00200059006D00700068006500630074002000610075007300730069002000732019007900200072006500740072006F007500760065002000640061006E0073000A006300650074002000E9006300680061006E00670065002E001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cela lui permet de mettre la dureté de son corps\nà l’épreuve et d’évoluer sans avoir à s’inquiéter !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mouais, j’y crois moyen...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F0075006100690073002C0020006A20190079002000630072006F006900730020006D006F00790065006E002E002E002E00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En tout cas, Monorpale a l’air d’aller beaucoup\nmieux, et c’est grâce à Ymphect !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci à vous deux d’avoir aidé mon Monorpale !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065007200630069002000E000200076006F007500730020006400650075007800200064201900610076006F00690072002000610069006400E90020006D006F006E0020004D006F006E006F007200700061006C00650020002100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les Pokémon aussi font parfois des échanges de\nbons procédés !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
